Welcome to my homepage! 

I am a Ph.D. candidate with the [https://ece.hkust.edu.hk/ Department of Electronic and Computer Engineering (ECE)], [https://hkust.edu.hk/ The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (HKUST)], Hong Kong. 
I am privileged to be advised by [https://eekhaled.home.ece.ust.hk/ Prof. Khaled B. Letaief].
I work on space computing power networks for 6G.
Previously, I received my B.Eng. degree with honors in 2021 and my M.S. degree in 2024 from [https://www.shanghaitech.edu.cn/eng ShanghaiTech University], Shanghai, China, both in computer science, working with [https://shiyuanming.github.io/ Prof. Yuanming Shi] and [https://dingzhuwen.github.io Prof. Dingzhu Wen].\n

Outside research, I enjoy music and poker. My favorite singer is Cantopop legend [https://music.youtube.com/channel/UC5xTFUiRH4Kxqdwh63pgdUA Alan Tam], affectionately known as \"Principal Tam,\" and my favorite poker player is [https://www.youtube.com/@TonyLinPoker Tony Lin]. I admire them both for their remarkable vitality and resilience, which is what draws me to them.\n

#You can find my CV [files/cv_lizeng.pdf here].

